/-!
# One shared scale: `ν Johnson.TriaugmentedDodecahedron.polyhedron`

`johnsonTriaugmentedDodecahedron_nu_shared_list`: **every system of `johnsonTriaugmentedDodecahedron_nu_roots_list` has its one root at the scale
`ν Johnson.TriaugmentedDodecahedron.polyhedron`** (`PolynomialSystem.IsRootEq`, `Modules/System/PolyRootEq.lean`): it is the one system. `johnsonTriaugmentedDodecahedron_nu_reps_list`:
the same for the same system, and `johnsonTriaugmentedDodecahedron_nu_reps` the statement in Mathlib's terms alone (`IsPolyRootEq`):
`ν Johnson.TriaugmentedDodecahedron.polyhedron` is the first coordinate of the root of each of these systems, each with exactly one root in its
box; it implies `IsPolyRootMax` (`IsPolyRootEq.isPolyRootMax`). There is one system (`PolynomialSystem.IsRootMax.isRootEq_singleton`).
Generated by `lean/scripts/exact_n.py` from the theorems of `Nieuwland.Certs.NieuwlandJohnsonTriaugmentedDodecahedron`, `Nieuwland.Certs.NieuwlandJohnsonTriaugmentedDodecahedron.Exact` and
`Nieuwland.Certs.NieuwlandJohnsonTriaugmentedDodecahedron.Roots`, which it does not change.
-/

namespace Nieuwland.Polyhedra

set_option maxHeartbeats 0 in
/-- **Every system of `ν Johnson.TriaugmentedDodecahedron.polyhedron` has its one root at `ν Johnson.TriaugmentedDodecahedron.polyhedron`**: each of the systems of `johnsonTriaugmentedDodecahedron_nu_roots_list` has exactly one root, and its scale is the Nieuwland number. -/
theorem johnsonTriaugmentedDodecahedron_nu_shared_list :
    PolynomialSystem.IsRootEq [johnsonTriaugmentedDodecahedron_nu_system_0] Johnson.TriaugmentedDodecahedron.polyhedron.nieuwland :=
  PolynomialSystem.IsRootMax.isRootEq_singleton johnsonTriaugmentedDodecahedron_nu_roots_list

/-- **The representatives of `ν Johnson.TriaugmentedDodecahedron.polyhedron`**: the same system, each with exactly one root, at the scale `ν Johnson.TriaugmentedDodecahedron.polyhedron`. -/
theorem johnsonTriaugmentedDodecahedron_nu_reps_list :
    PolynomialSystem.IsRootEq [johnsonTriaugmentedDodecahedron_nu_system_0] Johnson.TriaugmentedDodecahedron.polyhedron.nieuwland :=
  johnsonTriaugmentedDodecahedron_nu_shared_list

section

